<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.4.3">
<l>emmaṉāveṉ kulateyvamē yeṉṉuṭai yanāyakaṉē</l>
<l>niṉṉuḷēṉāyp peṟṟanaṉmai yivvulaki ṉilārpeṟuvār</l>
<l>nammaṉpōlē vīḻttamukkum nāṭṭiluḷ ḷapāvamellāñ</l>
<l>cummeṉātē kaiviṭṭōṭit tūṟukaḷ pāyntaṉavē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Our King! My family deity! My lord!</l>
<l>Who in this word will obtain the goodness</l>
<l rend="indent">that was obtained by me who is inside you?</l>
<l>All the sin in the country that fell and was crushed,</l>
<l rend="indent">being just like one of us,</l>
<l>was unable to breath and abandoned [me] fleeing,</l>
<l rend="indent"> leaping into the bushes.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
